## Prerequisites

- Go 1.26+ (optional — falls back to Docker if not installed)
- Docker
- Make

## Common Workflows

### Build and test with the released action kit

```bash
make build
make test
```

### Build and install into a running DeltaFi

```bash
make install
```

### Build and test with a local action kit

```bash
LOCAL_GO_ACTION_KIT=true make build
LOCAL_GO_ACTION_KIT=true make test
```

By default this uses `../deltafi/deltafi-go-action-kit`. Override with:

```bash
LOCAL_GO_ACTION_KIT=true LOCAL_GO_ACTION_KIT_PATH=../path/to/kit make build
```

### Install a plugin built with the local action kit

```bash
LOCAL_GO_ACTION_KIT=true make install
```

## All Targets

```bash
make build       # Build the plugin binary
make test        # Run all tests
make install     # Build Docker image and install into DeltaFi
make docker      # Build Docker image (tagged :latest and :VERSION)
make publish     # Build and publish multi-architecture Docker container
make lint        # Run linter and vet
make fmt         # Format code
make tidy        # Format code and tidy modules
make clean       # Remove build artifacts
make very-clean  # Remove build artifacts and cached modules
make help        # Show build environment and available targets
```

